Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}すごい　オボット！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 奥博特！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}ヘタクソ　ヘタクソ。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菜鸟 菜鸟。
